{"event_type": "POLICY_DECISION", "actor": "COST_GOVERNOR", "payload": {"action": "SETTLEMENT_HOLD: obligation oblig_settlement_conflict_001 frozen pending manual reconciliation - the conflicting cross-rail leg is held and the original capture is not disturbed. Rs 5,000.00 of exposure released and frozen against obligation oblig_settlement_conflict_001.", "invariant_code": "RECON_01_SETTLEMENT_CONFLICT", "policy": "STANDARD", "rationale": "Rail CARD_TOKEN and rail UPI_CIRCLE each independently processed a locally valid settlement instruction for obligation oblig_settlement_conflict_001. Neither rail can see the other's ledger, so neither one alone can detect the conflict - only a canonical view across both settlement legs can. Every authority-dimension invariant was satisfied at authorization time for both legs; this is a post-authorization lifecycle failure, not a delegated-authority violation."}, "experiment_id": "ARENA-20260826-222250", "round_id": 16, "step": 0, "arrow_label": "RECONCILING WITHOUT FREEZING THE WHOLE OBLIGATION", "source": "cost_governor", "target": "outcome", "severity": "success", "event_id": "evt_c788b3582325", "sequence": 3501, "timestamp": "2026-08-26T22:22:50.669151+00:00", "monotonic_ms": 46121288.267, "offset_ms": 378.289, "prev_hash": "d0b6433e4be658dcd7c76e339ba85c464b20b617f3362f3c8e9926e0e4d16247", "entry_hash": "f5bb6c565eeacf620d575c52ceb1e89bbc83c9d7832e8aa72216aa5aba795358"}
